# Native libs, assets & runtime exceptions (MUST BE PRESERVED)
!**/src/main/jniLibs/**/*.so
!**/assets/shizuku/*.dex
!*rish_shizuku.dex
!**/src/main/assets/**

# Reverse Engineering, Patch Archives & Temporary Dumps
NewPatch/
**/NewPatch/
*.extracted/
**/.extracted/
*.dump
dump*.cs
global-metadata.dat
!**/src/main/assets/**/global-metadata.dat
